### Business Profile API Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Create Business Profile - Success
POST {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Tech Innovators Inc.",
  "industry": "TECHNOLOGY",
  "businessSize": "SMALL",
  "growthStage": "EARLY_GROWTH",
  "annualRevenue": 1500000,
  "numberOfEmployees": 25,
  "numberOfLocations": 2,
  "yearEstablished": 2018,
  "exitTimeline": "3-5 years",
  "description": "A cutting-edge software development company specializing in AI and machine learning solutions.",
  "website": "https://techinnovators.example.com"
}

### 2. Create Business Profile - Minimal Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Quick Start LLC",
  "industry": "RETAIL",
  "businessSize": "MICRO",
  "growthStage": "STARTUP"
}

### 3. Create Business Profile - Invalid Industry (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Test Company",
  "industry": "INVALID_INDUSTRY",
  "businessSize": "SMALL",
  "growthStage": "STARTUP"
}

### 4. Create Business Profile - Missing Required Fields (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Test Company"
}

### 5. Create Business Profile - Invalid Website URL (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Test Company",
  "industry": "TECHNOLOGY",
  "businessSize": "SMALL",
  "growthStage": "STARTUP",
  "website": "not-a-valid-url"
}

### 6. Get All Business Profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get Business Profile by ID
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID from create response
GET {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Business Profile by ID - Not Found (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get Business Profile by ID - Invalid UUID (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/invalid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Update Business Profile - Full Update
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Tech Innovators Inc. (Updated)",
  "industry": "TECHNOLOGY",
  "businessSize": "MEDIUM",
  "growthStage": "ESTABLISHED",
  "annualRevenue": 3500000,
  "numberOfEmployees": 75,
  "numberOfLocations": 3,
  "yearEstablished": 2018,
  "exitTimeline": "5-10 years",
  "description": "Updated description with new achievements and milestones.",
  "website": "https://techinnovators-updated.example.com"
}

### 11. Update Business Profile - Partial Update
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "businessName": "Tech Innovators Group",
  "numberOfEmployees": 100
}

### 12. Update Business Profile - Clear Optional Fields
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "annualRevenue": null,
  "exitTimeline": null,
  "website": null
}

### 13. Update Business Profile - Invalid Year (Should Fail)
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "yearEstablished": 2050
}

### 14. Get Business Profile Statistics
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Delete Business Profile
# Replace {profileId} with actual ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Delete Business Profile - Not Found (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Delete Business Profile - With Assessments (Should Fail)
# This should fail if the profile has associated assessments
# Replace {profileId} with ID of a profile that has assessments
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles/{profileId}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Create Business Profile - Without Auth Token (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/business-profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Unauthorized Test",
  "industry": "TECHNOLOGY",
  "businessSize": "SMALL",
  "growthStage": "STARTUP"
}

